---
const curve = (f: (x: number) => number) =>
  Array.from({ length: 121 }, (_, i) => {
    const x = (i * Math.PI) / 120;
    return `${i ? 'L' : 'M'}${40 + (220 * i) / 120},${200 - 50 * f(x)}`;
  }).join(' ');
---

<figure>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 280 240"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="am2-calor-title am2-calor-desc"
  >
    <title id="am2-calor-title">A parábola e o primeiro modo de Fourier</title>
    <desc id="am2-calor-desc">
      Entre zero e pi, o dado x vezes pi menos x e o primeiro modo oito sobre pi
      vezes seno de x têm extremos nulos. No centro, o modo vale cerca de 2,546
      e excede o dado, cerca de 2,467.
    </desc>
    <text x="40" y="23">
      Temperatura
    </text>
    <path class="axis" d="M40 45V200H266" />
    {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((y) => (
      <g>
        <path class="tick" d={`M36 ${200 - 50 * y}H40`} />
        <text x="27" y={205 - 50 * y} text-anchor="end">
          {y}
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <path class="data" d={curve((x) => x * (Math.PI - x))} />
    <path class="mode" d={curve((x) => (8 / Math.PI) * Math.sin(x))} />
    <text x="40" y="222" text-anchor="middle">
      0
    </text>
    <text x="150" y="222" text-anchor="middle">
      π/2
    </text>
    <text x="260" y="222" text-anchor="middle">
      π
    </text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <span>
      <i class="key data" aria-hidden="true"></i> Dado: x(π − x).
    </span>
    <span>
      <i class="key mode" aria-hidden="true"></i> Primeiro modo: (8/π) sin(x).
    </span>
    No centro: π²/4 ≈ 2,467 e 8/π ≈ 2,546.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  figure {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  text {
    fill: var(--text);
    font:
      15px 'Manrope Variable',
      sans-serif;
  }
  path {
    fill: none;
  }
  .axis,
  .tick {
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .data {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .mode {
    stroke: var(--text);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  figcaption {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  figcaption span {
    display: block;
  }
  .key {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 24px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-right: 4px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .key.mode {
    border-top: 2px dashed var(--text);
  }
</style>
